### ============================================================
### Station (kiosk) login — {{gym1StationCode}} / {{gym2StationCode}}
### are filled from the live API: run attendance.http > syncGym1StationCode
### (or open the Station Code page in the app) before this folder.
### ============================================================

### Station (kiosk) login with the 6-digit code — no deviceId, no token.
### Response: { gymId, gymName, token } — the token binds the station to its gym.
# @name stationLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kiosk/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{gym1StationCode}}"
}

###
### Wrong code → 401 INVALID_STATION_CODE
# @name stationLoginWrongCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kiosk/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "000000"
}

###
### Short code → 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
# @name stationLoginShortCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kiosk/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "12345"
}

###
### Second gym's station
# @name stationLoginGym2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kiosk/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{gym2StationCode}}"
}
